{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨年にやった 「16人のプリンシパル」の映像を\n「16人のプリンシパルtrois」の前に\n見る事ができるとゆー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木坂アクトMOVIE」～伝説のパルコ公演～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6/11\n2012年9月7日に行われた公演の上映\n～西野七瀬\"私は鳥を目指してはいない\"～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のトークに出演させていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/20/7757761/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サブタイトルに中田の名前は無いけど\n中田も出ますよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーちゃん、ちーちゃんと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/20/7757761/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は6位三月ウサギを\nやらせてもらった回ですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/20/7757761/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださるかたに\n楽しんでもらえるお話ができるか心配だけど\nいろいろお話できたらいいな～＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/20/7757761/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変えてないよ～\n最近までキャリアメール使ってたから\n10KBしか添付できなかったんだけど\nフリーメールに変えたから容量増えたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/05/20/7757761/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまりないけど行ったことあるよー！\n年に2